==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|frm|quel}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|quel}}, from {{inh|fr|la|qualis|quālis, quālem}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr|Fr-quel.ogg|audio}}
* {{homophones|fr|quelle|quelles|quels}}

===Adjective===
{{fr-adj}}

# [[which]]
#: '''''Quel''' mec a volé mon pantalon ?''
#:: ''Which guy stole my trousers?''
# (exclamative) [[what]]
#: '''''Quelle''' catastrophe !''
#:: ''What a catastrophe !''

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|which}} {{q|Louisiana|Cajun French}} {{l|fr|équel}}

===Pronoun===
{{fr-pron|g=m|f=quelle|mp=quels|fp=quelles}}

# {{lb|fr|interrogative}} [[what]]
#: '''''Quel''' est son nom ?''
#:: ''What is his name?''

